[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "樹里、聞いたか？\r\n一次審査を通過したぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001010010,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "え？　一次審査って……\r\nどのオ－ディションのことだ？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "011",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/701100101/7011001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん、 『W.I.N.G.』のだよ！",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001010020,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』のって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100101/7011001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001010030,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……ええっ？　アタシが？　ま、まじかよっ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100101/7011001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、今さっき連絡が来たんだ！",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これまで真面目に練習してきた結果だな",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001010040,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "う、うるせ－な、ちょっと運が良かっただけだ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100101/7011001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことないぞ\r\n樹里が頑張っていたのをみんなちゃんと見てたんだ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "宣材写真も良いの撮れたしな、だから運とか言わずに……",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001010050,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "わ、わかったよ。わかったから……ったく",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100101/7011001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001010060,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……ほんとプロデュ－サ－は、いちいち真面目だな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100101/7011001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当のことを言ってるだけだよ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それにしても、まだ一次審査とはいえ通過できるなんて\r\nやっぱり嬉しいもんだな。樹里もそうだろ？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001010070,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……まぁ、悪くない気分だよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100101/7011001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001010080,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "最初は「アタシに何ができんだよ」って思ってたんだけど\r\n少しずつわかってきたっつーか",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100101/7011001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001010090,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アイドル活動続けたら……\r\nもっと手応えが掴めんのかな",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100101/7011001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、きっとそうだよ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001010100,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……なんて言って、\r\nあっさり二次で落ちるかもしんね－けどな",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100101/7011001010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうならないためにも、これからも頑張ろう！",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001010110,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "わかったよ……ま、そこそこにな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100101/7011001010110"
  },
